  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 326eb5a0f061640298066e65657482b6, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "T\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p: \u0111\u1ECDc chi\u1EC1u s\xE2u, \u0111\u1ED5i
    m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EE1 v\xE0 d\xF9ng gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n b\u1EA3n l\u1EC1; kh\xF4ng
    th\xEAm c\xFA b\u1EAFt bi tr\xEAn kh\xF4ng. B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P12 + P19 \u2014
    m\u1ED9t l\u1ED3ng v\xE0 m\u1EA1ng kho\u1EA3ng 8\u201310 kh\xFAc \u0111\u1ED5i
    h\u01B0\u1EDBng trong c\u1EA7u k\xEDnh.\nRecovery: Chia tuy\u1EBFn th\xE0nh c\xE1c
    v\xF9ng c\xF3 khoang ngh\u1EC9; nh\xE1nh sai ng\u1EAFn v\xE0 quay l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c;
    kh\xF4ng d\xF9ng to\xE0n b\u1ED9 21 kh\xFAc ngo\u1EB7t c\u1EE7a P12 g\u1ED1c"
